{title: Tu Aata Hai Seene Me}
{artist: M S Dhoni Palak Muchhal Amaal Malik}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]Tu aata [C]hai seene mein
[Am]Jab jab [A#]saansein bharti hoon
[Dm]Tere dil [C]ki galiyon se
[Am]Main har [A#]roz guzarti hoon
[Dm]Hawaa ke jaise [C]chalta hai tu
[Am]Main ret [A#]jaisi udti hoon
[Dm]Kaun tujhe [C]yun pyar karega
[Am]Jaise main [A#]karti hoon
[Dm]Ho [C]ho hoohoho
[Am]Ha ha ha [A#]haha ha ha
[Dm]Meri nazar [A#]ka safar
[F]Tujhpe hi [C]aake ruke
[Dm]Kehne ko [A#]baaqi hai kya
[F]Kehna tha [C]jo keh chuke
[Dm]Meri nigaahein hain
[A#]Teri nigahon ki
[F]tujhe khabar [C]kya be-khabar
[Dm]Main tujhse hi [C]chhup chhup kar
[Am]Teri aankhen [A#]padhta hoon
[Dm]Kaun tujhe [C]yun pyaar karega
[Am]Jaise main [A#]karta hoon
[Dm]Ho [C]ho?.
[Am]Ha [A#]ha ha
[Dm]Tu jo [A#]mujhe aa mila
[F]Sapne [C]hue sirphire
[Dm]Hathon mein [A#]aate nahi
[F]Udte hain [C]lamhe mere
[Dm]Meri hansi tujhse
[A#]Meri khushi tujhse
[F]Tujhe khabar [C]kya be-qadar
[Dm]Jis din [C]tujhko na dekhun
[Am]Pagal pagal [A#]phirti hoon
[Dm]Kaun tujhe [C]yun pyaar karega
[Am]Jaise main [A#]karti hoon
